<h2 id="forty-seconds">Forty Seconds I Can't Stop Replaying</h2>
<p>The ambulance came and they checked him over. He was fine. He ate a popsicle on the couch and was asleep by 7:30.</p>
<p>I didn't sleep at all.</p>
<p>I kept playing it back. The quiet. The look. The fourth thrust.</p>
